%
O1000 (FLANGE: TWO BOLT CIRCLES, A TYPICAL SHOP PROGRAM)
(T1 = 8 MM DRILL)
G17 G21 G40 G49 G80 G90
G91 G28 Z0.
G90 G54
T1 M6
G0 G43 H1 Z50.
S1200 M3
M8
G65 P9100 X0 Y0 R40. A0 B6. Z-12. C2.
G65 P9100 X0 Y0 R60. A15. B8. Z-8. C2.
G80
M9
G91 G28 Z0.
M30
O9100 (BOLT CIRCLE: X Y CENTRE, R RADIUS, A START, B HOLES, Z DEPTH, C R-PLANE)
IF [#18 EQ #0] THEN #3000 = 101 (RADIUS MISSING)
IF [#2 EQ #0] GOTO 900
IF [#2 LT 1.] GOTO 900
#10 = 0
WHILE [#10 LT #2] DO1
#11 = #1 + #10 * 360. / #2
G99 G81 X[#24 + #18 * COS[#11]] Y[#25 + #18 * SIN[#11]] Z#26 R#3 F150.
#10 = #10 + 1.
END1
G80
M99
N900 #3000 = 102 (HOLE COUNT MISSING OR BELOW 1)
M99
%
